<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "A Malaysian enforcement officer to whom the relevant pass has been issued under subsection (3) shall, upon the request by the Government of the Republic of Singapore authorities, produce his pass or other evidence of identity for verification while performing official duties at Woodlands North Station."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
