<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "A Malaysian enforcement officer may, while performing official duties at Woodlands North Station, wear the uniform or any visible distinctive insignia of his enforcement agency."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The Government of Malaysia shall recall any of the Malaysian enforcement officer deployed at Woodlands North Station if required by the Government of the Republic of Singapore."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "7" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "The Government of Malaysia shall, not less than seven days before the date of the deployment of a Malaysian enforcement officer at Woodlands North Station comes to an end, notify the Government of the Republic of Singapore in writing."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
