<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_8> <https://schema.org/text> "Where a Malaysian enforcement officer is recalled under subsection (6) or his deployment comes to an end, the Government of Malaysia shall ensure that the relevant pass issued to such Malaysian enforcement officer under subsection (3) is surrendered to the Government of the Republic of Singapore no later than the last day of the Malaysian enforcement officer’s deployment. Deployment of Republic of Singapore enforcement officer at Bukit Chagar Station"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
