<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Where a Republic of Singapore enforcement officer is recalled under subsection (5) or his deployment comes to an end, the Government of the Republic of Singapore shall ensure that the security pass issued to such Republic of Singapore enforcement officer under subsection (2) is surrendered to the Government of Malaysia no later than the last day of the Republic of Singapore enforcement officer’s deployment. Deployment of enforcement officer in exceptional circumstances"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
