<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_VI__cl_19__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where an act or omission constituting an offence under the written laws of Malaysia or the Republic of Singapore is committed in the area referred to in paragraph (1)(a) and the Governments may exercise their criminal jurisdiction in relation to the offence, the Government in whose territory the train journey is completed shall have the primary right to exercise its criminal jurisdiction."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_VI__cl_19__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_VI__cl_19> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
