<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_VI__cl_20> <https://schema.org/text> "The Government of Malaysia may exercise its criminal jurisdiction in relation to any act or omission constituting an offence under the written laws of Malaysia as specified in the Schedule committed in connection with customs, immigration and quarantine clearance functions and security functions in the designated area at the Woodlands North Station. Jurisdiction of court of Malaysia"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
