<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@/~part_VI__cl_21> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding any other written laws of Malaysia, any offence committed under any written law of Malaysia in which the criminal jurisdiction of which is provided under this Act, may be inquired into or tried before the court of competent jurisdiction in Malaysia and where such offence is committed outside Malaysia, the offence shall be deemed to have been committed at any place within Malaysia."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/eng@> .
